/// M30 HISTORY-045 "Guide coverage: required phrases".
/// Source: tests/baseline/t26_product_guide_test.go symbol
/// TestT26ProductGuideCoversContracts (L30-130) plus
/// t26Guide const (L18).
/// Disposition: historical_candidate (this row pins the
/// TestT26ProductGuideCoversContracts offline pact as
/// reviewable Can facts; the old Go check stays until
/// the integrator retires it after every linked row,
/// variant, environment and control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the guide coverage facts in
/// Go order: the eight platform names, the ten action
/// recipe names plus limits, the four SQL promise
/// names, the two race plus shutdown names, the four
/// owner plus replay names, the two offline limit
/// phrases, the four stream plus deferral plus
/// comparison names, and the required total.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): each
/// phrase pins its Go literal inner bytes; counts pin
/// ints tallied from the required list. phrase-bun-darwin
/// pins darwin bundle (L39); phrase-bun-linux pins linux
/// bundle (L40); phrase-debian pins Debian 13 (L41);
/// phrase-glibc pins glibc 2.41 (L42); phrase-chromium
/// pins chromium 140 (L43); phrase-webkit pins webkit 26
/// (L44); phrase-firefox pins firefox (L45);
/// phrase-postgres pins PostgreSQL 17.11 (L46);
/// phrase-save-invoice pins save_invoice (L48);
/// phrase-save-invoice-form pins save_invoice_form (L49);
/// phrase-load-invoice pins load_invoice (L50);
/// phrase-8192 pins 8192 (L51); phrase-64-row pins
/// 64-row (L52); phrase-2048 pins 2048 (L53);
/// phrase-lines-order pins lines_order (L54);
/// phrase-serve-form-action pins serve_form_action (L55);
/// phrase-422 pins 422 (L56); phrase-allow pins allow
/// (L57); phrase-libpg-query pins libpg_query (L59);
/// phrase-row-limit pins row_limit_parameter (L60);
/// phrase-commit-unknown pins commit_unknown (L61);
/// phrase-sql-unsafe pins sql.unsafe (L62);
/// phrase-exactly-once pins exactly once (L64);
/// phrase-resource-state pins resource_state (L65);
/// phrase-owner-record pins owner record (L67);
/// phrase-owner-only pins owner-only (L68);
/// phrase-invoice-replay pins invoice_replay (L69);
/// phrase-operation-id pins operation_id (L70);
/// phrase-no-reload pins no reload durability (L72);
/// phrase-no-queue pins no automatic queue (L73);
/// phrase-close-reader pins close_reader (L75);
/// phrase-primary-error pins primary error (L76);
/// phrase-di-17 pins DI-17 (L77);
/// phrase-no-significance pins no significance is claimed
