/// Facet map (guide phrases in Go order):
/// phrase-bun-darwin, phrase-bun-linux, phrase-debian,
/// phrase-glibc, phrase-chromium, phrase-webkit,
/// phrase-firefox, phrase-postgres, phrase-save-invoice,
